# The changelog: almost every pull request adds one line at its top (newest first). union keeps both
# sides' lines instead of a conflict. The Gate carries a review across such a merge only when the merge
# adds there nothing but main's lines (scripts/gate.mjs, sharedChangeFromMain). docs/IDEAS.md stays on
# git's own merge: its ideas move between sections, and union could bring a moved idea back unseen.
public/changelog.json merge=union
